          "Hadith.110 - Imam Musa ibn Jafar Al-Kadhim (as) said:\n\"Consuming ushnan (a type of cleansing herb) melts the body, scrubbing with pottery wears out the body, and using a siwak in the bathroom causes bad breath”."
